DESCRIPTION:Rae Haynes (she/ they) is a contemporary artist and educator wh
 o lives and works in Magadjin/ Brisbane\, Australia. Rae has exhibited wid
 ely in independent spaces and art museums\, most recently with projects fo
 r Outer Space (2025)\, The Brisbane Festival (2023)\, the Wallach Art Gall
 ery\, Columbia University\, New York (2021)\, Institute of Modern Art (IMA
 ) (2020)\, and the Museum of Brisbane (2019). Rae completed a Doctor of Ph
 ilosophy in Visual Arts (2009) with the support of an Australian Postgradu
 ate Award for research and is a Senior Lecturer (Visual Arts) at QUT.
